WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:00.950
- Besides intense fans,

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:04.240
soaps are known for insane plot twists,

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:05.410
which are my favorite.

00:00:05.410 --> 00:00:08.460
So in honor of 14,000 episodes,

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:12.030
can you give me your top
three crazy Marlena moments?

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:14.170
Like, can you, like what's number three?

00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:16.250
If you had to pick the top three?

00:00:16.250 --> 00:00:17.430
- Out of character at one point,

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:22.430
Marlena was the Salem
Strangler, several things,

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:27.060
where she went around
dressed in a black cape

00:00:27.060 --> 00:00:29.040
and a black hood strangling people.

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.420
- That, you're like Jack
the Ripper, just like, yeah.

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:32.253
- Yeah, yeah.

00:00:32.253 --> 00:00:33.600
And nobody saw it coming; it was perfect.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.750
- That's amazing.

00:00:34.750 --> 00:00:35.800
How 'bout number two?

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.520
- My sister played Hattie Adams,

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.930
who was this crazy,
crazy woman on the show.

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:42.710
And then when she went back to teaching,

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:44.620
they said you can step in and play her.

00:00:44.620 --> 00:00:46.750
So I played Marlena for 40 years,

00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:51.170
and she's very understanding
and compassionate and patient,

00:00:51.170 --> 00:00:52.690
and not at all outrageous.

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:55.900
So playing Hattie was the most fun.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:57.399
Oh my gosh.

00:00:57.399 --> 00:01:00.830
- What's your number one Marlena moment?

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:03.150
- You know, I think the fans would agree,

00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:05.621
I think it's gotta be possession.

00:01:05.621 --> 00:01:07.320
(audience laughs)

00:01:07.320 --> 00:01:08.440
- [Kelly] (laughs) You got a clap!

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:09.630
- [Deidre] I have a fan there?

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:10.463
Okay, good.

00:01:10.463 --> 00:01:12.568
- Jason is freaking out,
my musical director.

00:01:12.568 --> 00:01:15.410
- It was completely surprising,

00:01:15.410 --> 00:01:17.910
and we've been watching things go,

00:01:17.910 --> 00:01:19.140
oh, there it is, yeah.

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:21.130
That, by the way, I was up in the air.

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:22.880
- Now, wait, yeah, that's what
I was just about to ask you.

00:01:22.880 --> 00:01:24.546
What happened there? How'd
you get that to do that?

00:01:24.546 --> 00:01:28.140
- That was done, I can't
tell you most of it,

00:01:28.140 --> 00:01:29.311
but that was actually,

00:01:29.311 --> 00:01:32.359
I'm gonna say a circus trick.

00:01:32.359 --> 00:01:33.782
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:33.782 --> 00:01:35.770
- So there were other parts of that set

00:01:35.770 --> 00:01:37.000
that you can't see there.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:39.249
And I did literally lift off the bed--

00:01:39.249 --> 00:01:41.280
- That's amazing.
- during the scene, right.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:42.770
- I would've felt amazing in that moment.

00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:43.603
- It was great.

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:44.436
- [Kelly] That's what I'm saying.

00:01:44.436 --> 00:01:45.269
- Also relieved that it worked,

00:01:45.269 --> 00:01:48.590
but it was Christmas Eve,
and everybody was in church,

00:01:48.590 --> 00:01:50.520
and I was home alone, and there it went.

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:52.963
Oops, she's off the bed.
- Oh my God, I love it.

00:01:52.963 --> 00:01:55.425
It's Christmas Eve, you're
possessed, this is amazing.

00:01:55.425 --> 00:01:59.253
It's just amazing.
(audience laughs)

